<title>MEXICO: Banco de Mexico to inject 860 mln pesos.</title>
<headline>Banco de Mexico to inject 860 mln pesos.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1997-01-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Banco de Mexico sought to drain 860 million pesos from the secondary market on Monday through two auctions to purchase paper, dealers said.</p>
<p>The auctions were offered as follows:</p>
<p>    AMOUNT     TERM</p>
<p>    560 million    10 days</p>
<p>    300 million     1 day</p>
<p>*Amounts in pesos</p>
<p>(( --Mexico City newsroom +525 728-9559))</p>
</text>
